{"id":"dc642dd12c05d028","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-numbering.md","title":"标准程序编号与部分函数编号","display":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-numbering","aliases":["20-df-numbering"],"display":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.5.1","source_pdf_pages":[46],"source_printed_pages":[10],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.5.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>10</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,e\\in\\omega\">\\(k,e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in S\">\\(a,b\\in S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{-1,+1\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{-1,+1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的有限机器结构码，与程序索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 分别使用。</p>\n<p>保留原程序编号参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e=\\mathsf P(e)\">\\(P_e=\\mathsf P(e)\\)</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}(e)=\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(\\mathsf P(e))],\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\\n[\\mathsf P(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M)))=M].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}(e)=\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(\\mathsf P(e))],\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\\n[\\mathsf P(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M)))=M].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些条件给出既有程序索引与有限状态、指令表之间的双向有效接口；不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\circ\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\circ\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}\\)</span> 是索引上的恒等函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e(\\vec x)\">\\(P_e(\\vec x)\\)</span> 使用上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\">\\(c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\)</span> 与正常停止输出关系。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota_S:S\\to2,\\qquad \\iota_S(\\sqcup):=0,\\qquad\\iota_S(1):=1,\\\\\n\\iota_D:\\{-1,+1\\}\\to2,\\qquad\\iota_D(-1):=0,\\qquad\\iota_D(+1):=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M):=\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{fcode}(Q),\n\\operatorname{fcode}\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\langle q,\\iota_S(a),q&#39;,\\iota_S(b),\\iota_D(d)\\rangle:\nq,q&#39;\\in Q,\\ a,b\\in S,\\ d\\in\\{-1,+1\\},\\ ((q,a),(q&#39;,b,d))\\in\\delta\n\\right\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:P_e(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota_S:S\\to2,\\qquad \\iota_S(\\sqcup):=0,\\qquad\\iota_S(1):=1,\\\\\n\\iota_D:\\{-1,+1\\}\\to2,\\qquad\\iota_D(-1):=0,\\qquad\\iota_D(+1):=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M):=\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{fcode}(Q),\n\\operatorname{fcode}\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\langle q,\\iota_S(a),q&#39;,\\iota_S(b),\\iota_D(d)\\rangle:\nq,q&#39;\\in Q,\\ a,b\\in S,\\ d\\in\\{-1,+1\\},\\ ((q,a),(q&#39;,b,d))\\in\\delta\n\\right\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:P_e(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结构码明确保存整个状态集和转移关系；配对码、有限集码及两个符号映射均为单射，因此它能唯一恢复机器。dec、enc 的全可计算性是关于原编号的显式前提，不使用停机判定，也不重新指定任何既有索引。第二个接口条件保证每台有限机器都有索引；不同机器的结构码经 enc 得到不同索引。增添不可达状态遂保留同一函数的无限多个程序索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.5.1；印刷页 10；PDF 第 46 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k,e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{-1,+1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"P_e=\\mathsf P(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}(e)=\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(\\mathsf P(e))],\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal M\\\n[\\mathsf P(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M)))=M].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathsf P}\\circ\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathsf P}","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota_S:S\\to2,\\qquad \\iota_S(\\sqcup):=0,\\qquad\\iota_S(1):=1,\\\\\n\\iota_D:\\{-1,+1\\}\\to2,\\qquad\\iota_D(-1):=0,\\qquad\\iota_D(+1):=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M):=\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{fcode}(Q),\n\\operatorname{fcode}\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\langle q,\\iota_S(a),q',\\iota_S(b),\\iota_D(d)\\rangle:\nq,q'\\in Q,\\ a,b\\in S,\\ d\\in\\{-1,+1\\},\\ ((q,a),(q',b,d))\\in\\delta\n\\right\\}\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:P_e(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\},\\\\\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2807,"backlinks":[{"id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。"},{"id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"fecd8e75f6904d75","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"2f9e8362ed1dce1d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。"},{"id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"6846dcaa8e4f345a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"e811ef811223aaaa","anchor":"ref-2"